msgctxt "80"
msgid "I can't believe this all actually happened..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "I'm sorry, Kiryu-san, I didn't mean to take up so much of your time..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Don't worry about it."
msgstr "Non preoccuparti."

msgctxt "128"
msgid "I... I gotta go apologize to Mina."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "It's my fault that Mina did what she did..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"I never thought about how she might feel. I just like, plowed ahead with "
"things, just to get everything all decided."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "We used to be like, such good friends..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"I can understand why you might not get along so well right now, but why "
"don't you try to forgive one another?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Friendship is fragile. It doesn't take much to smash it to pieces."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"But friendships can come out of those painful experiences, forged together "
"to become stronger than it ever was before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "I'm sure your hearts are still connected."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "You have a really big heart, Kiryu-san.."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Mine's like, still really small..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "I wouldn't say that."
msgstr "Oh, non direi proprio."

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"I'm still gonna go to Istanbul. There's like, so many things I've gotta see "
"and experience there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Giusto."

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"Today's gonna be my last day with you! I can't have you bailing me outta "
"stuff like, forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Heh... All right."
msgstr "Eh... D'accordo."

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"I really like you, Kiryu-san. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default> So, "
"like, why don't we make our last day one to really remember?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"Hehehe! <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default> C'mon, you know what I mean."
" <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default> You're so cute, I might have to "
"like, take you with me. "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "...This is the place, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "All right... You're sure about this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Yeah, super sure."
msgstr ""

